sanctioned: the import-less arity-0 kernel value Uuid.v4 / Uuid.v7 evaluates to a fresh String call on the Rust backend (the documented bare-reference form), so the length and version-nibble checks hold. The Go reference leaves the bare reference as a kernel function value (CLAUDE.md Limitation #7 — arity-0 kernel codegen) and its checks differ on this shape. Sky-Rust records its own output.
